Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://trindle.org
Description: A small desktop that lives in one ring
 Trindle is a mouse-driven desktop for Debian. There is no menu bar and no
 dock along the edges: the apps, the settings, the clock and the tray all live
 in one ring, which appears when it is called for and goes away when it is not.
 .
 This package holds the desktop itself, which is one program, together with the
 login screen, the session, the boot menu theme and the disk-password screen.
